Depends: glibc, openssl-glibc, bash, ncurses
Conflicts: opencode-wrapper
Description: OpenCode glibc standalone (frozen single-version rollback package)
 Single frozen version for rollback only. Coexists with the native
 `opencode` package (no conflicts on literal `opencode`) but is mutually
 exclusive with `opencode-wrapper` (both ship bin/opencode-wrapper entry).
 Independent lib prefix usr/lib/opencode-wrapper/.
